I am now in my flat.
It is very peaceful here.
I am standing in the kitchen.
I am making dinner.
There is a pot on the stove.
The local red rice is boiling in it.
This red rice is very tasty.
I look at the fresh vegetables.
I have carrots and beans.
I am washing them in water.
Now, I am chopping the vegetables.
The knife is very sharp.
I chop them slowly.
I am singing a song.
It is an upbeat song.
I am humming happily.
There is a nice smell in the kitchen.
The rice is ready now.
I turn off the stove.
My dinner is ready.
